<title>USA: PHLX to list Paul Harris options May 16.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list Paul Harris options May 16.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philadelphia Stock Exchange said Tuesday it would begin trading options on Paul Harris Stores Inc on May 16.</p>
<p>It said the options would open with strike prices of 15, 17-1/2 and 20, with initial expirations in June, July, October and January. Position limits have been set at 7,500 contracts.</p>
<p>Susquehanna Investment Group has been named specialist for the options, PHLX said.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
